Package: localhome
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: LocalHome
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.13), python3 (<< 3.14), mosquitto, avahi-daemon, libnss-mdns, adduser, unattended-upgrades
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Description: Heating, cooling and ventilation of a home, run on the board itself
 LocalHome drives the zones' valves, the dehumidifier and the VMC through
 Shelly devices over MQTT, with a home page for the residents and an admin
 panel for the installer. Its data stay in /var/lib/localhome, also when the
 package is removed.
